  "description": "Complete preserved E004 packet and attributed common P7/P9 inquiry occurrences. Proposed languages and prior model criticism are supplied as occurrences, not endorsed warehouse facts. The packet_json_text field is the exact original UTF-8 JSON file text; parse it as JSON without reinterpreting literal escape sequences inside its strings.",
